{title: Kaisa Ye Ishq Hai}
{artist: Isk Risk Rahat Fateh Ali Khan}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am] ... [Dm]Koi bole dariya hai,        [Am]kaisa kaisa hai isq
[Dm]Koi maane sehra hai,        [Am]kaisa kaisa hai isq
Koi [Am]sone sa tole re,        koi [F]matti sa bole re
Koi [G]bole ke chaandi ka hai [Am]chhura,        Hota [Am]aise yeh mauke pe
Roka [F]jaaye na roke se,        Accha [G]hota hai hota hai yeh [Am]bura
Kaisa yeh isq [Am]hai..        [G]ajab sa risk [Am]hai
[Am]Muskilon mein yeh daale,        [Am]Jo bhi chaahe kara le
[F]Badle yeh dilon ke [G]faisle,        [C]Mann ka mauji, isq toh ji
[F]Albeli si raho pe [Am]le chale,        Koi [Am]peeche na aagey hai
Phir bhi [F]jaane kyun bhaage hai,        Mara [G]isq ka isq ka dil [Am]mera dil mera
Isake [Am]uske yeh hisse mein,        Tere [F]mere yeh kisse mein
Maula [G]sikhe bin seehke bih de [Am]sikha,        Kaisa yeh isq [Am]hai..
[G]ajab sa risk [Am]hai,        Kaisa yeh isq [Am]hai..
[G]ajab sa risk [Am]hai,        [Am]Ga.ga.ga..gaga maga
[F]Ga.ga.ga..gaga maga,        [F]Ga.ga.ga..gaga maga [G]re gare gare
[Dm] ... [Am] ... [F] ... [Am],        [Am]Naina lage to jaage bina dori ya dhage
[F]Bandhte hai do naina [G]khwaab se,        [C]Na ataa ho, na pata ho
[F]Kore naino mein koi [Am]aa basse,        Isska [Am]uska na isska hai
Jaane [F]kitna hai kiska hai,        Kaisi [G]bhasha mein,
bhasha mein hai [Am]likha, yeh isq yeh,        Isake [Am]uske yeh hisse mein
Tere [F]mere yeh kisse mein,        Maula [G]seekhe bin, seehke bih de [Am]sikha
Kaisa yeh isq [Am]hai.. [G]
